  "question": {
    "html": "<p>Masses X and Y rest on a smooth horizontal surface and are connected by a massless spring. The mass of X is 3.0 kg and the mass of Y is 6.0 kg. The masses are pushed toward each other until the elastic potential energy stored in the spring is 1.0 J.</p>\n<p><figure data-asset-id=\"fig_01\"><img alt=\"Source question diagram 1\" src=\"asset:fig_01\"/></figure></p>\n<p>The masses are released. What is the maximum speed reached by mass Y?</p>\n<p>[1]</p>\n<ol class=\"mcq-options\"><li data-label=\"A\">0.11 m s<sup>−1</sup></li><li data-label=\"B\">0.33 m s<sup>−1</sup></li><li data-label=\"C\">0.45 m s<sup>−1</sup></li><li data-label=\"D\">0.66 m s<sup>−1</sup></li></ol>"
  },
